# Collaboration & Golden Rules
:::

:::shape id=petPeeveBg at=center width=520 height=460 offsetX=-280 offsetY=56 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::icon id=petPeeveIcon at=center offsetX=-480 offsetY=-136 name=alert-triangle size=32 color=#EF4444
:::

:::text id=petPeeveTitle at=center width=400 height=40 offsetX=-230 offsetY=-136 preset=caption align=left color=#DC2626
PET PEEVES
:::

:::text id=petPeeveText at=center width=460 height=340 offsetX=-280 offsetY=60 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=18
• **Unscheduled Comms:** Avoid unscheduled interruptions for non-urgent matters.

• **Refusal Without Reasons:** Avoid rejecting ideas or proposals without explaining why.
:::

:::shape id=goldenRuleBg at=center width=520 height=460 offsetX=280 offsetY=56 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=16
:::

:::icon id=goldenRuleIcon at=center offsetX=80 offsetY=-136 name=check-circle size=32 color=#10B981
:::

:::text id=goldenRuleTitle at=center width=400 height=40 offsetX=330 offsetY=-136 preset=caption align=left color=#059669
MY GOLDEN RULES
:::

:::text id=goldenRuleText at=center width=460 height=340 offsetX=280 offsetY=60 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=18
1. **Advance Notice:** Notify me beforehand for any synchronous check-ins.

2. **Reasoning & Alternatives:** Provide reasons for refusals and suggest alternative ideas when possible.
:::
